```

Counting calls: how many calls (of both `ev` and `od`, including the first) are made while evaluating `ev(7)`?

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int n_calls = 0;
int od(int n);
int ev(int n){ n_calls++; return n == 0 ? 1 : od(n-1); }
int od(int n){ n_calls++; return n == 0 ? 0 : ev(n-1); }
int main(void){ ev(7); printf("%d", n_calls); return 0; }
```

